  "content_id": "16136214",
  "title": "Ravencoin RVN Network Fees",
  "description": "Ravencoin (RVN) Network – Asset Transfers on Bitcoin Tech\nRavencoin is built for issuing and transferring digital assets, with low and pre...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ5035CVNN72SV3YWVNZRXN\">Ravencoin (RVN) Network – Asset Transfers on Bitcoin Tech</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Ravencoin is built for issuing and transferring digital assets, with low and predictable transaction fees.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ5035C1YQDGNB78TJY3DH8\">How RVN Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Transaction size</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Paid in <b>RVN tokens</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge estimates the fee automatically based on real-time network status.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ5035CBDDD0AV38M6R6Y5H\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b></p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ5035CTWN9Z98249EAN8T9\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Typically <b>$0.005 to $0.02 USD</b> per transaction.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ5035CW2HPD56DDZTZWDQ9\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Ravencoin’s low fees are perfect for token creation and transfers. Edge makes sending RVN smooth and cost-efficient.</p>",
